[{"type":"message","user":"U022XT7GY95","text":"\u003c@U022XT7GY95\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622203586.382400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f38cb237-d3b9-44ce-a088-5edec7934449","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"vim-tiny にフォールバックするっだっけか。すぐにapt install vim vim-gtk3 vim-nox とかしちゃうけど。","ts":"1622184043.381600","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1622184059.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4xE9I"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U0238J4KU7P","text":"\u003c@U0238J4KU7P\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622184041.381400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"\u003c@U0238G3KV8D\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622182200.379900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"211a8282-4dc0-4135-9287-a39f1fdfda8d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ディストリが赤帽系なら`dnf remove`に読み替えてね。","ts":"1622180894.379600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7gQ/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b63e821-b803-4b63-94b7-402029d44c26","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"一番推奨される解決方法。`apt purge -y nano`","ts":"1622180729.378800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":3,"users":["U01D44KSY9Z","UD1FQV38V","U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U021YCLHK5L","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rMDz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"877372fd-3eae-48cc-89be-2f85f2ceca84","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"このあいだのsudoおじさんのページでオプション確認...か?\n環境変数引き継いで動かせばいいかな?","ts":"1622180503.378000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L7Jx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6719e37-6fdb-4348-b47a-18e6737ac158","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"というか `sudo visudo` だから一般ユーザでexportしても意味ないんだった","ts":"1622180442.377400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cz68U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95daa644-d2e0-4db9-aecf-2ff87fb119a4","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"サーバーとかに入ったら真っ先に `export EDITOR=vim` しますね\nそうしないとvisudoがまともに使えない\nviつってんのになんでnano起動するんだよ！","ts":"1622180418.376800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qSE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"728cee5f-74f8-493f-b08c-b1d6ece622f5","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"そうnanoか～","ts":"1622180067.375600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":3,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PK7"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023Q50PZMF","text":"\u003c@U023Q50PZMF\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1622180038.375300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"5db690a2-702e-4adf-8ea0-d89602a750db","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Ubuntuだと$EDITOR=nanoだから初めて開いて抜けられなくなった人は少なそう?\n(個人的にはnano嫌だけど)","ts":"1622179612.375100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZDn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae6ab47b-be3b-4df5-a6e0-b97d04e48a57","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"書き込んじゃダメでは (マジレス)","ts":"1622178928.373400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+dxS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4116a50d-df08-4412-b455-981fc9843641","type":"message","user":"U01TQP86UM6","text":"そしてバッファ上に表示されそう","ts":"16221784